<title>USA: Paris, Texas, won by Prudential Securities.</title>
<headline>Paris, Texas, won by Prudential Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities said it won $5 million of Paris, Texas, waterworks and sewer system revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.1784 percent.</p>
</text>
